{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.02]Watch a young niggas surf (Woah-woah)\n[00:02.96]I'll put 'em in the dirt (Woah-woah-woah-woah)\n[00:05.94]I'll show him what he's worth (Woah-woah)\n[00:07.68]If he run up on a the turf, watch a young nigga surf (Whoa-whoa)\n[00:10.72]I'ma surf (Woah-woah), I'ma surf, I'ma surf, I'ma surf (Woah-woah)\n[00:14.22]I'ma surf (Woah-woah), I'ma surf (Woah-woah)\n[00:16.66]I'ma surf, I'ma surf, I'ma surf (Swoo-Swoo)\n[Verse]\n[00:20.16]I'm surfin' (Surfin'), motherfucker, I'm surfin' (Motherfucker, I'm surfin')\n[00:24.44]Keep talkin' crazy I'ma hop in ya' bitch give d' like a surgeon (Yes I am, yes I am)\n[00:29.08]A nigga think I'm cold (Swhoa), but I'm colder in person (Yes I am, yes I am)\n[00:34.10]She said how old is you, bae (What I say?) I said that I'm older in person (Yes I am)\n[00:37.94]Bitch, I'm surfin', swoah (Swoo)\n[00:40.48]And you know a nigga doing it (And you know a nigga doing it)\n[00:44.82]Your girl (Woah), shit, you know a nigga doing it (And you know a nigga doing it)\n[00:49.64]Your girl (Woah), shit, you know a nigga through with that (And you know a nigga through with that)\n[00:54.42]Your name (Woah), shit, I don't fall for the stupid shit (Hell no)\n[00:57.90]I pull up in this bitch like, woah (Woah), they know a young surfin' (Swhoa)\n[01:01.94]In the kitchen whippin' like I'm serving up dessert (Woah)\n[01:04.28]Niggas talking dumb until I put 'em in the dirt, he a pussy ass nigga, he belong in a skirt (swhoa)\n[01:09.12]All my niggas ballin', boy, I swear it gets worse (Swhoa), I'm the best nigga, that's a gift and a curse (Woah)\n[01:13.90]Niggas, run up they get put in the dirt, motherfucker, I'm surfin', what, what? (Swhoa, ayy)\n[01:19.76]My niggas got pounds (My niggas got pounds)\n[01:22.04]If you tryna take them, ooh, my niggas got rounds (All my niggas got rounds)\n[01:26.82]And if you run up on me, oh no, oh no, I blow yo' ass down (I blow yo' stupid ass down)\n[01:31.60]And I'm the motherfuckin' king, let's go, let's go, I need that crown (It's mine)\n[01:35.64]Bitch, I'm surfin', Swhoa (Swhoa), ayy, I run up on yo' turf (Yes I will)\n[01:40.88]Treat yo' ass like a lil' twerp (Lil' kid), kill yo' ass then I make your girlfriend twerk (Whoa)\n[01:45.10]Puttin' in a work (Woah), servin' hella chickens, I ain't talkin 'bout church (Woah)\n[01:48.70]Holy on my side, boy, I'm servin' out of church (Preach)\n[01:51.10]Niggas talking dumb, that's okay, I swear to God I pull up like skrrt shoot 'em make a nigga surf (Swhoa-swhoa-swhoa-swhoa-swhoa-swhoa-swhoa-swhoa, swhoa)\n[01:57.74]Ayy, ayy, what the fuck a nigga on right now? (What the fuck a nigga on?)\n[02:00.56]I'm off so much (Swhoa), I smoke so much (Swhoa), a young nigga gone right now, I'm surfin' (Oh yeah, I'm gone)\n[02:06.42]Hit my nigga line, he servin' (Swhoa-swhoa)\n[02:09.96]He was wippin' in the kitchen (Woah), like he driving motherfuckin' swervin, woah, woah\n[02:15.18]Ayy, I'm surfin, surfin', grown ass man (I'm a grown ass man)\n[02:19.58]No father in my live, it's okay, it's alright, I'm a grown ass man (I'm a grown ass man)\n[02:24.46]I'm just coolin' with the fam (Swhoa), in the motherfuckin' land\n[02:28.00]Got my head on a thing I don't really give a damn (Woah-woah-woah-woah)\n[02:30.48]If you run up on me, motherfucker up a yam, boy I swear, it's not a scam\n[02:33.90]It's real (It's real), niggas know that I'm surfin' (Niggas know that I'm surfin')\n[02:39.62]Swhoa (Swhoa), I'm colder in person (I'm colder in person)\n[02:44.32]I'm swaggin' (Swaggin', ayy), I'm swervin' (I'm swervin', swervin')\n[02:49.02]I'm surfin' (Surfin')\n[02:50.12]Bitch, I'm surfin' (Surfin')\n[02:51.12]Bitch, I'm surfin' (I'm surfin'), bitch, I'm surfin' (Bitch I'm surfin')","words":[[1.02,1.18,"Watch"],[1.24,1.24,"a"],[1.32,1.54,"young"],[1.6,1.78,"niggas"],[1.86,2.12,"surf"],[2.22,2.92,"(Woah-woah)"],[2.96,3.04,"I'll"],[3.08,3.26,"put"],[3.3,3.38,"'em"],[3.44,3.52,"in"],[3.6,3.66,"the"],[3.7,3.94,"dirt"],[4.0,5.9